+reads the file that says whether it can *move* — `GLOBAL_TERMINAL_PROOF_CUT_V1.json` — and finds a
+closed loop. Not a missing asset. Not unmerged code. A permission that is voided by the act of working.
+**Authority: NONE. Credit: 0.**
+
+---
+
+## 1. What `main` says about itself today
+
