+                         G0_NOVEL_PREDICATE_OPERATOR_OR_EMIT_STRUCTURE
+```
+
+**Zero implementation classes remain. Ten proof obligations remain. Nothing can be consumed until a
+prequalification passes.**
+
+## 2. That prequalification already passed — twice over, by an external runner
+
+`canonical/verification/TERMINAL_PREQUALIFICATION_CURRENT_PUBLIC_RUNNER_PASS_20261002_V2.json`:
+
+```
+status   INDEPENDENT_PASS__EXACT_CURRENT_12_OF_12_STATE_AUTHORIZES_PARALLEL_TERMINAL_WAVE
+         __ZERO_TERMINAL_RESULTS
+verified EXACT_CURRENT_BLOBS_BOUND · REDUCER_REGRESSIONS_PASS · 12_OF_12_TERMINAL_ROUTES_FROZEN_
+         ADMISSIBLE · ALL_FOUR_PORTFOLIO_BLOCKER_LISTS_EMPTY · ALL_REQUIRED_PREWAVE_GATES_PASS ·
