+## 3. And it is void — 4 of its 6 pinned blobs have changed
+
+The verdict binds six exact blobs. Under the project's own rule —
+`VERIFICATION_APPLIES_ONLY_TO_EXACT_LISTED_BLOBS__ANY_SEMANTIC_BYTE_CHANGE_REQUIRES_REVERIFICATION` —
+comparing them to today's tree:
+
+| blob | pinned 2026-10-02 | today | |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `EXACT_FOUR_PORTFOLIO_PREQUALIFICATION_V1.json` | `d85f90df76db` | `5d20073180fd` | **CHANGED** |
+| `BEHAVIORAL_CONTRACT_REGISTRY_V1.json` | `afa00109031d` | `ee187f611a0e` | **CHANGED** |
