+So `EXECUTION_AUTHORITY_TRUE` refers to bytes that no longer exist. The very file the live guard points
+at as the thing to satisfy has itself moved out from under its verifying receipt.
+
+## 4. Why it cannot simply be re-verified
+
+`canonical/governance/OPEN_DOMAIN_PREQUALIFICATION_DEADLOCK_AUDIT_V1.json` (2026-10-02) already found
+the deeper defect: `FAIL_CLOSED_CONTROLLER_DEFECT_FOUND` — the gate demanded *whole open-domain scope
+equivalence* of contracts that only ever had **finite or bounded preflight populations**. It corrected
