+- **TB4 is physically capped on free compute**: Docker rejects the 8-CPU tasks, only ~46/330 fit ≤4 CPU →
+  **maximum attainable 46/330 = 13.9 % < 66.36 % required, even with a perfect producer**;
+- 275 of 314 private-repo workflows cannot run (Actions billing block);
+- a TB4 pass costs ≈13,200 model calls → ≥13 days per attempt on free tiers.
