+## 5. The loop
+
+```
+work on the project  →  a governance blob changes  →  the 10-02 authorization is void
+        ↑                                                        ↓
+re-verify: needs exact Opus 5.5 comparator  ←  live guard blocks T0–T3 pending prequalification
+        ↓
+that access is EXTERNAL_BLOCKED at $0 by the project's own laws
+```
