+`fresh_terminal_evidence_consumed: 0` for 34 days is therefore **not apathy and not a missing asset**.
+It is what the documents require. Every commit re-stales the only evidence that released the terminal
+wave, and the re-verification is forbidden by the same law that demands it.
+
+This also revises my own twenty-seven-pass finding. "Declarations outnumber enforcements" is not a
+cultural flaw in this project — it is the **mechanism**: each declaration edits a blob, which voids a
+prior verification, which demands a new declaration.
+
+## 6. The most valuable specification in the repository, never executed
+
+Inside `FOUR_UNCOVERED_BEHAVIORAL_PROOF_CONTRACTS_V1.json` the terminal goal is finally written as four
+executable contracts — universe, oracle, mutations, pass rule — e.g.:
