+
+These are finite, zero-cost, mutation-tested, and **run by nothing** (`terminal_results_observed: 0`).
+Four portfolios — T0 coding/semantic geometry, T1 professional finance/artifact/vision, T2 interactive
+agency/composition, T3 research/unknown domain — with twelve frozen routes, all admissible, all idle.
+
+## 7. The answer
+
+**No — this is not all of them, and what was missing is not an item on a list.**
+
+It is the reason the list never changes. The project's value is *specified* — four portfolios, twelve
+routes, four proof contracts with oracles and mutations, 348 unmerged modules that execute, one external
