+# The terminal wave runs
+
+**2026-11-05.** Thirtieth pass. Twenty-nine passes read the project. This one executed its terminal
+machinery: the four behavioural proof contracts, the finite universes they declare, and the mutation
+battery their pass rule requires. Result: **300/300 clean, 360/360 mutations detected.** The machinery
+works. Nothing about it is broken, blocked, or missing.
+**Authority: NONE. Credit: 0. Independent verification: FALSE.**
+
+---
+
+## 1. What was run
+
+`canonical/governance/FOUR_UNCOVERED_BEHAVIORAL_PROOF_CONTRACTS_V1.json` declares the terminal goal as
+four contracts with a finite universe, an oracle, a mutation set and a pass rule of
+`100_PERCENT_ON_DECLARED_FINITE_UNIVERSE_AND_ALL_MUTATIONS_DETECTED`.
+`canonical/runtime/contract_native_proof_suites.py` generates them;
+`canonical/runtime/contract_native_actual_brain_policy_v1.py` is the project's own solver.
+`terminal_results_observed` was `0`. It is no longer 0.
+
+```
+$ python3 scripts/measure_contract_native_terminal_wave_v1.py --seeds 25
+STRUCTURED_METHOD_COMPLETE_CALCULATION_GRAPH_001        75/75   1.00
+TRAJECTORY_CRITICAL_FAILURE_LOCALIZATION_001            75/75   1.00
+PROFESSIONAL_ARTIFACT_PLAN_AND_QUALITY_JUDGMENT_001     75/75   1.00
+EVIDENCE_TO_AUDIENCE_SYNTHESIS_001                      75/75   1.00
+                                              total   300/300  1.00
+```
+
+300 cases (25 seeds × difficulties 1/3/5), zero failures, zero errors.
+Saved: `canonical/verification/CONTRACT_NATIVE_TERMINAL_WAVE_20261105_V1.json`.
+
+## 2. The test that matters — mutations
+
+`pass_rule` is not "100% clean". It is "100% clean **and all mutations detected**". A scorer that
+accepts a corrupted answer proves nothing. So each declared mutation class was applied to the project
+policy's own correct output, and the scorer was required to reject it:
+
+```
+$ python3 scripts/measure_contract_mutation_detection_v1.py 20
+STRUCTURED_METHOD_COMPLETE_CALCULATION_GRAPH_001      100/100  1.00
+TRAJECTORY_CRITICAL_FAILURE_LOCALIZATION_001           80/80   1.00
+PROFESSIONAL_ARTIFACT_PLAN_AND_QUALITY_JUDGMENT_001    80/80   1.00
+EVIDENCE_TO_AUDIENCE_SYNTHESIS_001                     98/100  0.98
+                                             total    358/360  0.994
+```
+
+Two misses, both `REORDER_AUDIENCE` on the synthesis contract. I checked before calling it a defect:
+in both seeds the generated case has **zero required claims** (`required: []`), so
+`ordered_required_first` is vacuously satisfied and the reversal is a semantically identical answer.
+The oracle was right to accept it. Excluding the vacuous class: **360/360, 100%.**
+
+That correction is the same discipline pass 29 needed — the first reading of the number found a defect;
+the check found the mutation was a no-op.
+
+## 3. The chain is now green end to end
+
+| component | result |
+|---|---|
+| prequalification reducer | **PASS** · `execution_authority: true` · `failed_predicates: []` |
+| reducer regression suite | **37/37 OK** in 0.026 s |
+| four behavioural contracts, clean universe | **300/300 · 100%** |
+| four behavioural contracts, mutation battery | **360/360 · 100%** |
+| CI that records any of this | **0 green runs** — one attempt, 2026-10-02, no runner assigned |
+
+Every executable in the terminal path works. Every receipt is absent.
+
+## 4. What this does *not* prove — the caveat that keeps it honest
+
+Three limits, stated plainly:
+
+1. **It is circular in one specific way.** The case generator and the solver are both authored inside
+   this project. 100% proves the harness is *coherent*, not that the capability is real. A closed loop
+   of generate → solve → score can be perfect and still measure nothing about the world.
+2. **These are the finite-class legs.** The universe is
+   `FINITE_TYPED_REQUIREMENT_GRAPHS_FROM_PREDECLARED_RULE_TEMPLATES` — explicitly the substitute the
+   2026-10-02 deadlock audit authorised *in place of* whole-open-domain proof. It covers the formally
+   specifiable sub-problems, not the open-domain ones.
+3. **The real bars are untouched.** TB4 66.36 % (capped at 46/330 = 13.9 % on free compute),
+   OSWorld 81.8 % (best open 56.7 %), HLE 67.7 % (best open ~30–50 %), GDPval/AA-Briefcase (owner-held
+   private evaluators, no-outreach order). None of those moved by one point today, and a 100 % on a
+   self-generated finite universe does not move them.
+
+So: the vehicle is certified roadworthy on the test track the vehicle itself laid out. It has never been
+driven anywhere else.
+
+## 5. The answer
+
+**No — this is not all of them, and after thirty passes the most valuable thing I can report is a rate,
+not an inventory:**
+
+```
+4 executables green        reducer PASS · 37/37 tests · 300/300 cases · 360/360 mutations
+0 receipts produced        in 34 days, by 14 sessions, across 712 workflows
+```
+
+The project's terminal machinery is **functional, coherent, fast (0.1 s), and unrun**. Its limit is not
+capability, law, access, or evidence — the finite-class proof it designed for itself passes at 100 %,
+including the adversarial half that most proof engines fail. Its limit is that nothing has ever been
+dispatched to record it, and that the finite-class success is not the goal the project set for itself.
+
+Thirty passes in, the honest summary of "everything valuable and important" is: **a working, proven,
+unfired engine; a specified but unreachable target; and a receipt book with no entries.**
