+Three properties fall out of the prior rather than being programmed: an untried gap scores 0.5 so
+**exploration is free**; a gap tried ten times and useless scores 0.045; and a gap worth 0.9 that
+takes an hour loses to one worth 0.6 that takes a second. Its own docstring: *"Nothing here
+enumerates what to learn."* With `test_ignorance_gap_restart_v1` it survives restart.
