+- **Value: the highest of anything in the repository, and it is the only asset that would be
+  expensive to rebuild.** Every other item below is *trustworthy only because this exists*. It has
+  already caught real defects by measurement (`docx_exact_text_edit` failed closed on empty-string
+  replacement; `same_identity_supervisor.execute_claimed_task` had no terminal-state guard). It is
