+## 4. Tier 3 — **Not real. Do not claim these.**
+
+This section is worth as much as Tier 1, because it is what a new person would otherwise get wrong.
+
+1. **The ownership matrix is not ownership.** It reports 7/19 families
+   `VERIFIED_OWNED_EQUAL_OR_BETTER` — and the project's own true-capability audit found
+   **15 of 19 families have an external model in the quoted route**, which is **zero credit** under
+   `NO_MODEL_PRODUCER_COGNITION`. Four families are marked PASS/VERIFIED while their route contains
+   a model: `COMPLEX_MULTI_TOOL_AGENCY`, `INSTRUCTION_FOLLOWING_SCOPE_AND_JUDGMENT`,
+   `TOOL_DISCOVERY_SELECTION_AND_LEARNING`, `EXACT_SYMBOLIC_COMPUTATION`. Treat 7/19 as an
+   aspiration and 15/19-with-a-model as the finding.
+2. **`truth.achieved` is `false`**, terminal authority was last evaluated 2026-10-05, and every
+   true-capability ledger row is `MEASURED_SANDBOX` with `authority: NONE`. Nothing here is
+   independently verified in the project's own sense.
+3. **"Instant learning" is learned-per-kind, not compounding.** The 2026-11-03 measurements are
+   decisive and self-authored: ten kinds, cold 1525 acts vs grown 1525 acts, **net saving 0,
+   improved 0/10**. Learning-to-learn beat the default 1/4 and the random mean 4/4 — the author
+   labels that `NO_COMPOUNDING` himself. The genuinely real part is smaller and still impressive:
+   **8/15 one-trial transfer** to a new instance of the same kind (up from 1/15), 6.33× mean trial
+   speedup, 0/15 regressions — and the target environment is consulted to **check**, not to
+   **learn** (store byte-identical after carry).
+4. **The suite has never been green, and that is correct.** Last honest baseline (2026-11-03):
+   **16,361 cases, 15,255 passed (93.2%), 984 failed, 42 errors, 80 skipped**, 344 files affected.
+   The backlog split: 48 environment, **789 real failures**, 189 blocked refusals, **486 regressions
+   vs the prior baseline, 303 standing debt.** Today's collection shows 16,976 tests and 42
+   collection errors. Missing modules blocking measurement: `PIL, cv2, cad_partspec, cadquery,
+   numpy, tree_sitter, polars, langdetect`.
+5. **"One artifact = one capability" is false.** The unified model makes 443 capabilities
+   *addressable*; it adds none. Its own non-claim says this.
+6. **The 18 skills are not capabilities** — `ACTIVE_VERIFIED_LEARNED_SKILL: 0` in the live catalog.
+7. **Not sentient.** `creature_runtime_v1` is the strongest contender and its docstring refuses the
+   claim: it cannot prove its work is good.
