+3. **Compounding does not work, and the cause is now a line number** (§2.3), not a mystery.
+4. **`truth.achieved` false**; 18 of 38 atomic predicates proved, 20 unresolved.
+5. **Suite: 16,361 cases, 15,255 passed (93.2%), 984 failed, 42 errors** (11-03 baseline); 789 real
+   failures, 486 regressions, 303 standing debt. Today: 16,976 collected, 42 collection errors.
+6. **Skills are not capabilities** (`ACTIVE_VERIFIED_LEARNED_SKILL: 0`).
+7. **Not sentient.** The 11-04 measurements say why, in the author's own numbers.
+
+---
+
+## 6. Defects — V1's eight plus five new ones
+
+**V1's eight, all still confirmed:** README example fails; README stale vs artifact
+(364/`d050fa…` vs 443/`9904fa…`); R1 closure gate red with 5 BLOB_DRIFT errors; frozen credited
+supervisor carries the fixed defect; 2 registry entries with no adapter; bare-name sibling import;
+~98 MB committed scratch; 3-incompatible capability counts (141/443/490).
+
+**New in V2:**
+
+| # | Defect | Severity |
+|---|---|---|
+| 6.1 | **The concept-bridge predicate (`meta_circular_organ_graph_v1.py:3953`) still excludes every program the synthesizer emits.** This is *the* blocking defect for the entire mission and it is one function | **Critical** |
+| 6.2 | **7 root `*.v1` files are byte-identical** (same sha256) and contain `pass:false` / `CONTRACT_VIOLATION_FOUND` — stale scratch named like capability contracts | High (misleading) |
+| 6.3 | **6 zero-byte `gz*` files** at the repo root | Low, but they are tracked junk |
+| 6.4 | **`OPUS_5_5_USEFUL_CAPABILITY_OWNERSHIP_V1.json` contradicts itself**: `status` says `5_OF_19_ACCEPTED__5_OF_19_VERIFIED_OWNED`, while its own `acceptance_truth` says `accepted_families: 7, verified_owned_families: 7`. Both cannot be the number an agent should quote | High |
+| 6.5 | **425 of 2,163 runtime modules have no docstring**, and ~1,900 modules are unreachable from any registry entry — an unattributed surface larger than the attributed one | Medium |
+| 6.6 | **92 of 595 verification records omit a `conclusion` field**, and 6 carry no run id at all, while their status strings say `INDEPENDENT_PUBLIC_RUNNER_PASS` — the repo's own AGENTS.md rule 4 requires a named verifier and a run reference | Medium |
+| 6.7 | **Two separate governance roots** (`/governance/` + `CAPABILITY_OWNERSHIP_LAW_V1.md` vs `canonical/governance/` + its policy) with no pointer saying which is live | Medium (reader trap) |
