+---
+
+## 7. Where the leverage now is — revised
+
+1. **Fix 6.1.** One predicate. It is the difference between a skill cache and a creature, and the
+   repo's own 11-04 note already specifies the test that must pass afterwards: a **period-12**
+   structure must cost strictly fewer oracle questions after periods 3, 5, 7 are compressed than cold
