+---
+
+## 8. One paragraph
+
+You have more than V1 said, and the missing part was the part that matters most to a stranger: a real
+independent-verification apparatus (578 external runs in a separate public repository, 2 recorded
+failures, zero credit by design) and a real model-independent acquisition frontier. You also have
+something rarer than either — a written record in which the system measured itself, found it was
+wrong, and kept the finding: a 12× speed-up that made it "faster and wronger while every status
+string said it succeeded." That discipline then located the actual deepest defect, and I verified
