+# The whole project — partition of everything, both repositories
+
+**2026-11-05.** Seventeenth pass. Previous passes partitioned `brain`. The phrase *"everything in the
+whole project"* requires the union, and the project is **two repositories plus one pinned snapshot**.
+This partitions all three. **Authority: NONE. Credit: 0.**
+
+---
+
+## 1. The union
+
+| store | tracked files | tracked MB | status |
+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| `moxnixmdj/brain` | 16,311 | ~234 | partitioned, 0 unclassified (working tree: 22,368 files / 914.5 MB) |
+| `moxnixmdj/verification-capsule-runner` | **6,605** | **54.3** | partitioned, **0 unclassified** |
+| **total** | **22,916** | **~288** | both exact |
+| Google Drive snapshot | 1 file | — | `PROJECT_BRAIN_CANONICAL_SNAPSHOT_2026-09-21.zip`, sha256 `000606bc…c01b0162`, **unreachable from here** |
+
+The runner is not a small companion. It is 6,605 files and 480,325 lines of Python — three times
+`brain`'s Python volume — plus 1,089 CI workflows.
+
