+## 3. The finding: 93 project paths exist in exactly one of the two repos
+
+Under `capsules/` there are 3,079 files resolving to **1,049 distinct project paths**.
+**956** are still present in `brain` at `main`. **93 are not.**
+
+| kind | count | examples |
+|---|---:|---|
+| `canonical/runtime/*.py` modules | ~30 | `universal_learning_optimizer_v2.py`, `tool_discovery_dynamic_refinement_v2.py`, `root1_capability_acquisition_controller_v1.py`, `p1_v5_contract_native_population_embedding_v1.py`, `terminal_next_action_compiler_v2.py` (in 3 capsules) |
+| `canonical/tests/test_*.py` for those modules | ~30 | `test_universal_learning_optimizer_v2.py`, `test_tool_discovery_dynamic_refinement_v2.py`, … |
+| `canonical/governance/*.json` | ~30 | `TOOL_DISCOVERY_DYNAMIC_REFINEMENT_V2.json`, `ROOT1_CAPABILITY_ACQUISITION_CONTROLLER_V1.json`, … |
+| **`canonical/verification/*_PUBLIC_RUNNER_VERIFICATION_*.json`** | **10** | `CHArtOGRAPHY_BRAIN_INSPECT_ADAPTER…`, `DELEGATION_CEILING_ACCEPTANCE…`, `MATCHED_SCOPE_ABDUCTIVE_RESIDUAL…`, `TERMINAL_NEXT_ACTION_COMPILER_V2…` |
+
+Verified against GitHub: `canonical/runtime/universal_learning_optimizer_v2.py` and
+`.../tool_discovery_dynamic_refinement_v2.py` both return **404 on `main`**, and neither
+`universal.learning.optimizer.v2` nor `tool_discovery.dynamic_refinement.v2` appears in
+`BOUND_CAPABILITY_REGISTRY_V1.json`.
+
+So this is not loss from `main` and not registered capability. It is **material that exists in exactly
+one place in the project** — including ten records whose filenames say *public runner verification*,
+i.e. the independent-check evidence the project treats as its highest-value artefact class.
+
+## 4. What "all of them" means now
+
+There is no single tree that contains the project. The accurate statement is:
+
+- `brain` holds the live runtime, the registry, the state, and the governance paper.
+- the runner holds the **only** copy of 93 project paths, the 403 capsules, 1,089 workflow definitions,
+  and 2,823 execution records with `workflow_run_id` / `head_sha` / `rc` / `terminal_state`.
+- the Drive snapshot holds one pinned, hash-verified bundle that neither repo can be checked against
+  from here.
+
+**A census of either repository alone is wrong.** Every earlier pass in this session that said
+"16,311 files" or "914.5 MB" was describing half the project.
